# Invictus live image = the installed system (design 2.1). One package per
# line; comments allowed. Invictus packages come from the [invictus-testing]
# repo that scripts/build-iso.sh builds (or, for a release, the published
# one); the rest from Arch.

# --- the installed system (docs/packages.md, "For the ISO") ---------------
invictus-base
invictus-desktop
invictus-tessera
invictus-atrium
# Named here so jack resolves to it, not jack2 (docs/packages.md, desktop).
pipewire-jack
# Boot splash and os-release (iso/own-needed; for pkgs/own or invictus-branding).
invictus-boot-branding
plymouth
# Calamares' "install alongside" needs to see other systems; LUKS on the
# Advanced path.
os-prober
cryptsetup

# --- live only (removed by the installer's cleanup job) ----------------------
invictus-installer
calamares
cage

# --- archiso essentials (from releng) -----------------------------------------
mkinitcpio-archiso
memtest86+-efi
edk2-shell
arch-install-scripts
squashfs-tools
gptfdisk
parted
